        "line": 21,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "We have seen some issues with devices in india, and got user on the call, made them try different DNS servers, and it worked."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 23,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 23,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "So if you have the issue, try to use a different DNS server like Cloudflare or Google DNS."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
