    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 99,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 99,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "When using local server for testing update, the app will ask for network permission, it's a normal behavior, it's not the case when you use a remote server."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 102,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 102,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Both OS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 104,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 104,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "When doing manual mode updates, some events are not easy to catch, for example the update fail triggers just before your JS code reloads, so you will not be able to catch it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 106,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 106,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "One alternative is to list the bundles and check error stats to know if the update fails."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 108,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 108,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "We need to find a better way to handle this in the future, but it's not a priority, since auto mode is the recommended way to do update."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 110,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 110,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "PRs are welcome to help us improve this."
        }
      ]
    },
